 - Using sqlc

Incorporated sqlc into cradle to generate type safe code from SQL.
sqlc allows you to define a yaml file, specifying your queries, schema, db type
for schema, you can pass a SQL schema definitions or migration files, where the up files will be subsequently applied
for queries, you can define parameterized SQL queries, where you decorate with a comment to specify the query name and resulting action (return one, many, or exec)


